    "detailed_description": "<strong> Story background </strong><br><br>The story of Xiantu starts from an unnamed island.<br>You, with exceptional talent, are originally cynical and neglectful of cultivation.<br>Entrusted by the immortal, you embarked on the path of cultivating immortals to the immortal world.<br>Exploring in the wilderness of Zezhou, gradually discovering the truth of the &quot;Immortal Path&quot;.<br><br><strong> Explore the Continent </strong><br><br>The path of immortality is long, and you have left the nameless island and set foot on the barren continent.<br>Explore the mainland, discover other sectarian forces, and advance the development of the story.<br>Collect various resources for self cultivation and building a sect.<br>Encounter various random events and obtain unexpected treasures.<br><br><strong> Simulated operation </strong><br><br>While exploring, you will also manage your own sect.<br>Collect reputation and sect resources to upgrade and build the sect.<br>Use different sect buildings to continuously produce various required props.<br>The powerful sect will assist you in going further in the path of immortality.<br><br><strong> Build a team </strong><br><br>As you move forward on the path of immortality, you will encounter many characters.<br>Different characters have different talents, professions, and skills.<br>Recruit the characters you need and freely form your team.<br>A reasonable combination of lineups can unleash greater power.<br><br><strong> Role development </strong><br><br>Even characters from the same profession may end up being vastly different.<br>Each character can choose one of six different paths.<br>Each character can practice different techniques and obtain different improvements.<br>Special: The protagonist can freely combine skills from various professions!<br><br><strong> Ascending the Fairy Realm </strong><br><br>After your feathering and soaring, you will head towards the fairyland at the end of the world.<br>Explore within the realm of immortality and discover the truth about the 'immortal path'.<br>The fairyland is far from the end, there is still a lot of content waiting for you to explore",
    "about_the_game": "<strong> Story background </strong><br><br>The story of Xiantu starts from an unnamed island.<br>You, with exceptional talent, are originally cynical and neglectful of cultivation.<br>Entrusted by the immortal, you embarked on the path of cultivating immortals to the immortal world.<br>Exploring in the wilderness of Zezhou, gradually discovering the truth of the &quot;Immortal Path&quot;.<br><br><strong> Explore the Continent </strong><br><br>The path of immortality is long, and you have left the nameless island and set foot on the barren continent.<br>Explore the mainland, discover other sectarian forces, and advance the development of the story.<br>Collect various resources for self cultivation and building a sect.<br>Encounter various random events and obtain unexpected treasures.<br><br><strong> Simulated operation </strong><br><br>While exploring, you will also manage your own sect.<br>Collect reputation and sect resources to upgrade and build the sect.<br>Use different sect buildings to continuously produce various required props.<br>The powerful sect will assist you in going further in the path of immortality.<br><br><strong> Build a team </strong><br><br>As you move forward on the path of immortality, you will encounter many characters.<br>Different characters have different talents, professions, and skills.<br>Recruit the characters you need and freely form your team.<br>A reasonable combination of lineups can unleash greater power.<br><br><strong> Role development </strong><br><br>Even characters from the same profession may end up being vastly different.<br>Each character can choose one of six different paths.<br>Each character can practice different techniques and obtain different improvements.<br>Special: The protagonist can freely combine skills from various professions!<br><br><strong> Ascending the Fairy Realm </strong><br><br>After your feathering and soaring, you will head towards the fairyland at the end of the world.<br>Explore within the realm of immortality and discover the truth about the 'immortal path'.<br>The fairyland is far from the end, there is still a lot of content waiting for you to explore",
    "short_description": "This is a casual strategic placement game. In the aerial world set in ancient China, players will play the role of a descendant of the Immortal Cultivation Sect. Travel through the barren continent, obtain various resources, build your sect, and ultimately ascend to the immortal realm.",
